    "source": "Design values for this project",
    "notes": [
      "Every number in this file is [DESIGN]: a starting value for tuning, not canon.",
      "power: an attacker's damage multiplier is sqrt(EP / power_reference_ep), so EP is quantity while skills and technique still matter.",
      "exposure: surviving exposure_to_resistance x max HP of one damage type earns its Resistance; each later step of the merge tree costs exposure_step_factor times more.",
      "capacity: every acquired skill reserves part of the magicule pool; skills granted at birth are free.",
      "forms: holding a Mimicry form costs form_upkeep_base x (the species' EP / your EP) magicules per second, clamped between the min and max, so forms get cheaper as you grow. A form's attacks hit with power sqrt(your EP / the species' EP).",
      "analysis times in other tables are the unlinked times in seconds; the Great Sage link multiplies them by analysis_link_factor."
    ]
  },
